# Non-parameterized function type alias: [Addable: [type [Fn@Integer [Integer Integer]]]]
# represents (Integer, Integer) → Integer. Annotating a lambda with @Addable enforces
# that it takes two Int params and returns Int.
[
  Addable: [type [Fn@Integer [Integer Integer]]]
  add: [@Addable [fn [let a@Integer b@Integer] a]]
  result: [add 3 4]
]
=== out
["Addable": ["Fn": Addable.Fn  "Integer": Addable.Integer]  "add": [fn [let a b] ...]  "result": 3]
